            <ArticleTitle>Pubic pain syndrome in sportsmen: comparison of radiographic and scintigraphic findings.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>250-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We studied 32 cases of pubic pain in sportsmen and compared the radiographic and scintigraphic findings. Six case histories are presented in detail. The pubis/sacrum uptake ratio obtained by the use of scan techniques appears to be a useful parameter for following the evolution of the pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
